### Culture — Endpoints/CultureEndpoints.cs. Public, no auth, no antiforgery
### (a plain GET) — writes the .AspNetCore.Culture cookie and redirects. The
### full-page redirect is what lets a new Blazor Server circuit pick up the
### culture (see CLAUDE.md's Localization section). Supported cultures: en, de.

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7105

### Switch to German, redirect back to Home
# @no-redirect
GET {{baseUrl}}/culture/set?culture=de&redirectUri=/

### Switch to English, redirect to the Listings page
# @no-redirect
GET {{baseUrl}}/culture/set?culture=en&redirectUri=/listings
